00, p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f 934 cm, skute\u010dnost 772 cm).\n165:   G3 p\u0159est\u0159el\u00ed nejv\u00edc o 63 cm, a to a\u017e na poklesu 10. 6.\n166: - Do vrcholu je chyba t\u00fdmov\u00e9ho modelu 54,2 cm a G3 45,4 cm, po vrcholu 38,9 a 36,8 cm. G3 je bl\u00ed\u017e skute\u010dnosti\n167:   v 56 % hodin.\n168: \n169: **V\u00fdhrady**\n170: - P\u0159edpov\u011bdi jsou **out-of-fold z LOFO-CV**: model, kter\u00fd p\u0159edpov\u00eddal tuto povode\u0148, se u\u010dil bez n\u00ed a bez 20 dn\u00ed p\u0159ed\n171:   a po. Je to jen **D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h a jedna povode\u0148, nen\u00ed to test.** Skute\u010dn\u00fd t\u00fdmov\u00fd model (u\u010den\u00fd 2006\u20132018) povode\u0148 2013\n172:   v tr\u00e9ninku m\u00e1, tak\u017ee v ostr\u00e9 p\u0159edpov\u011bdi by vy\u0161el jinak.\n173: - Povode\u0148 je vybran\u00e1, proto\u017ee je nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00ed a je na n\u00ed vid\u011bt rozd\u00edl. Celkov\u011b je obr\u00e1zek sm\u00ed\u0161en\u00fd. V LOFO p\u0159es 22 povodn\u00ed\n174:   je G3 lep\u0161\u00ed (13,94 proti 15,29 cm, lep\u0161\u00ed ve 20 z 22). Na 4 valida\u010dn\u00edch povodn\u00edch je ale hor\u0161\u00ed (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h 18,2 proti\n175:   15,5 cm) a prohr\u00e1v\u00e1 u povodn\u00ed s t\u00e1n\u00edm sn\u011bhu (2006, 2011). T\u00fdm proto G3 do fin\u00e1le nevzal, viz `ROZHODNUTI_G3.md`.\n176: \n177: **Co chyb\u00ed**\n178: - \u010c\u00e1ra \u201ebude jako te\u010f\u201c v grafu nen\u00ed, aby z\u016fstal \u010diteln\u00fd. Jej\u00ed chyba v okn\u011b je 97,4 cm.\n179: - Chyb\u00ed \u00dast\u00ed a horizonty 12 a 36 h. Ostatn\u00edch 5 velk\u00fdch povodn\u00ed je v grafu session ridge\n180:   `ridge_dan\\grafy\\srovnani_g3_tym_povodne.png`.", "src/evaluate.py": "1: \"\"\"Spole\u010dn\u00e9 rozd\u011blen\u00ed na train / val / test a vyhodnocen\u00ed. Nikdo ho nem\u011bn\u00ed jen pro sv\u016fj model.\n2: \n3: - train: 2006\u20132018 bez valida\u010dn\u00edch povodn\u00ed a 20 dn\u00ed kolem nich\n4: - val: 4 vynechan\u00e9 povodn\u011b (16 dn\u00ed p\u0159ed vrcholem a\u017e 5 dn\u00ed po n\u011bm) a klidn\u00e9 roky 2019\u20132020\n5: - test: 2021\u20132025 (povodn\u011b 12/2023 a 9/2024), pou\u0161t\u00ed se jednou na konci, rozhoduje Ondra.\n6:   Fin\u00e1ln\u00ed model se pak tr\u00e9nuje na v\u0161em do konce 2020.\n7: \"\"\"\n8: import numpy as np\n9: import pandas as pd\n10: \n11: from data import SPA, nacti\n12: from features import NEJSTARSI\n13: \n14: POVODNE_VAL = [\"2006-04-03\", \"2009-03-07\", \"2010-09-29\", \"2011-01-17\"]\n15: KLID_VAL = (\"2019-01-01\", \"2020-12-31\")\n16: TEST_OD = \"2021-01-01\"\n17: OKNO_VAL, PRED, PO, VYNECHAT = pd.Timedelta(days=16), pd.Timedelta(days=7), pd.Timedelta(days=5), pd.Timedelta(days=20)\n18: \n19: \n20: def povodne(H, prah):\n21:     \"\"\"Vrcholy povodn\u00ed, kdy stav p\u0159e\u0161el pr\u00e1h (v\u00edc ne\u017e 7 dn\u00ed od sebe = r\u016fzn\u00e9 povodn\u011b).\"\"\"\n22:     s = H[H >= prah]\n23:     useky = []\n24:     for t in s.index:\n25:         if useky and t - useky[-1][1] <= pd.Timedelta(days=7):\n26:             useky[-1][1] = t\n27:         else:\n28:             useky.append([t, t])\n29:     return [H[a:b].idxmax() for a, b in useky]\n30: \n31: \n32: def casti(cil, horizont, finalni=False):\n33:     \"\"\"Pro ka\u017edou hodinu 'train', 'val', 'test' nebo '' (nepou\u017e\u00edt).\"\"\"\n34:     H = nacti()[f\"{cil}_H\"]\n35:     c = pd.Series(\"train\", index=H.index)\n36:     if not finalni:\n37:         vrcholy = [H[pd.Timestamp(d, tz=\"UTC\") - pd.Timedelta(days=3):][:144].idxmax() for d in POVODNE_VAL]\n38:         for v in vrcholy:\n39:             c[v - OKNO_VAL - VYNECHAT: v + PO + VYNECHAT] = \"\"\n40:         c[KLID_VAL[0]:KLID_VAL[1]] = \"val\"\n41:         for v in vrcholy:\n42:             c[v - OKNO_VAL: v + PO] = \"val\"\n43:     c[TEST_OD:] = \"test\"\n44:     # vstupy (a\u017e 36 h zp\u011bt) i c\u00edl (t + horizont) mus\u00ed le\u017eet ve stejn\u00e9 \u010d\u00e1sti, jinak \u0159\u00e1dek vynech\u00e1me\n45:     ok = (c == c.shift(-horizont)) & (c == c.shift(NEJSTARSI))\n46:     return c.where(ok, \"\")\n47: \n48: \n49: def varovani(y, pred, prah, horizont):\n50:     \"\"\"Varov\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159ed p\u0159ekro\u010den\u00edm prahu. y a pred: index je \u010das vyd\u00e1n\u00ed t, hodnota je stav v t + horizont.\n51: \n52:     P\u0159edstih je nejv\u00fd\u0161 horizont: d\u0159\u00edv\u011bj\u0161\u00ed varov\u00e1n\u00ed znamen\u00e1, \u017ee model ohl\u00e1sil povode\u0148 d\u0159\u00edv, ne\u017e mohla p\u0159ij\u00edt.\n53:     Prop\u00e1snut\u00e1 povode\u0148 se do pr\u016fm\u011brn\u00e9ho p\u0159edstihu po\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 jako 0.\n54:     \"\"\"\n55:     hodiny = pd.date_range(y.index.min(), y.index.max(), freq=\"h\")\n56:     y, pred = y.reindex(hodiny), pred.reindex(hodiny)\n57:     alarm = (pred >= prah).astype(int)\n58:     # za\u010d\u00e1tek povodn\u011b: skute\u010dn\u00fd stav p\u0159ejde pr\u00e1h a 4 dny p\u0159edt\u00edm byl zm\u011b\u0159en\u00fd a pod n\u00edm\n59:     pod = (y < prah).astype(float).where(y.notna())\n60:     zacatky = hodiny[(y >= prah) & (pod.shift(1).rolling(96, min_periods=96).min() == 1)]\n61:     predstih, propasnuto = [], 0\n62:     for t in zacatky:\n63:         vydane = alarm[t - pd.Timedelta(hours=48): t + pd.Timedelta(hours=horizont - 1)]\n64:         if vydane.any():\n65:             predstih.append(min(horizont, horizont - (vydane.idxmax() - t) / pd.Timedelta(hours=1)))\n66:         else:\n67:             predstih.append(0.0)\n68:             propasnuto += 1\n69:     # plan\u00fd poplach: souvisl\u00fd \u00fasek varov\u00e1n\u00ed (mezery do 6 h spoj\u00edme), b\u011bhem kter\u00e9ho ani den po n\u011bm\n70:     # skute\u010dn\u00fd stav pr\u00e1h nep\u0159ekro\u010dil (y[t] je stav v t + horizont, proto od s - horizont)\n71:     a = alarm.rolling(7, min_periods=1).max()\n72:     starty = hodiny[(a == 1) & (a.shift(1, fill_value=0) == 0)]\n73:     konce = hodiny[(a == 1) & (a.shift(-1, fill_value=0) == 0)]\n74:     plane = sum(not (y[s - pd.Timedelta(hours=horizont): e + pd.Timedelta(hours=24)] >= prah).any()\n75:                 for s, e in zip(starty, konce))\n76:     return dict(povodni=len(zacatky), predstih_h=round(float(np.mean(predstih)), 1) if predstih else None,\n77:                 propasnuto=propasnuto, plane_poplachy=int(plane))\n78: \n79: \n80: def vyhodnot(y, pred, cil, horizont):\n81:     \"\"\"Metriky jedn\u00e9 p\u0159edpov\u011bdi (stav v cm). y a pred maj\u00ed stejn\u00fd index, \u010das vyd\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159edpov\u011bdi.\"\"\"\n82:     pred = pd.Series(np.asarray(pred, dtype=float), index=y.index)\n83:     e = (pred - y).abs()\n84:     spa1, spa2, spa3 = SPA[cil]\n85:     okno = pd.Series(False, index=y.index)\n86:     vrcholy = []\n87:     for v in povodne(y, spa2):\n88:         okno[v - PRED: v + PO] = True\n89:         # p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f vydan\u00e1 horizont hodin p\u0159ed vrcholem, kladn\u00e1 = nadhodnotil\n90:         vrcholy.append(pred[v] - y[v])\n91:     out = dict(\n92:         mae=round(e.mean(), 1),\n93:         mae_povodne=round(e[okno].mean(), 1),\n94:         # kladn\u00e1 = model na povodn\u00edch soustavn\u011b nadhodnocuje (pozor, nadhodnocov\u00e1n\u00ed zlep\u0161uje p\u0159edstih)\n95:         bias_povodne=round((pred - y)[okno].mean(), 1),\n96:         mae_nad_1spa=round(e[y >= spa1].mean(), 1),\n97:         chyba_vrcholu=round(float(np.mean(np.abs(vrcholy))), 1),\n98:         vrcholy_o_kolik=[round(float(v)) for v in vrcholy],\n99:         radku=len(y),\n100:     )\n101:     for n, prah in ((2, spa2), (3, spa3)):\n102:         out |= {f\"spa{n}_{k}\": v for k, v in varovani(y, pred, prah, horizont).items()}\n103:     return out"}

