{"origin/dan-nejistota:nejistota_dan/ZPRAVA_NEJISTOTA.md": "# P\u00e1smo nejistoty p\u0159edpov\u011bdi: zpr\u00e1va\n\nDan, v\u011btev `dan-nejistota` (z `origin/main` 59956c9), noc 23./24. 10. 2026. Pr\u016fb\u011bh v `PRUBEH.md`, n\u00e1lezy Codexu\nv `NALEZY_CODEX.md`. Test 2021\u20132025 se nepou\u017eil.\n\n## Shrnut\u00ed\n\n- Ke ka\u017ed\u00e9 p\u0159edpov\u011bdi (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn a \u00dast\u00ed, 12/24/36 h) je p\u00e1smo, do kter\u00e9ho m\u00e1 skute\u010dnost padnout v 80 % a 95 % hodin.\n  Po\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 se pro t\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge (fin\u00e1ln\u00ed model) a pro Danovy kandid\u00e1ty Ridge 30 stanic a G3 (\u00bd Ridge 30 + \u00bd LightGBM 30).\n- **Dne\u0161n\u00ed t\u00fdmov\u00e9 p\u00e1smo je na povodn\u00edch moc \u00fazk\u00e9.** `src/nejistota.py` bere chyby modelu na u\u010dic\u00edch datech (kde je model\n  zn\u00e1) a ve vno\u0159en\u00e9 kontrole na 22 povodn\u00edch 2006\u20132020 \u201e80% p\u00e1smo\u201c v jeho stylu pokr\u00fdv\u00e1 jen 58\u201372 % hodin, p\u0159i rychl\u00e9m\n  vzestupu 27 % a na za\u010d\u00e1tku vzestupu 15 %. Aplikace ukazuje 90% p\u00e1smo z t\u00e9ho\u017e postupu.\n- **Nov\u00e9 p\u00e1smo** bere chyby p\u0159edpov\u011bd\u00ed mimo tr\u00e9nink (LOFO p\u0159es 22 povodn\u00ed) zvl\u00e1\u0161\u0165 podle toho, jakou zm\u011bnu model \u010dek\u00e1\n  (6 p\u00e1sem p\u0159edpov\u011bzen\u00e9 zm\u011bny). Ve vno\u0159en\u00e9 kontrole (p\u00e1smo ka\u017ed\u00e9 povodn\u011b jen z ostatn\u00edch povodn\u00ed) pokr\u00fdv\u00e1 **79\u201380 %**\n  (c\u00edl 80 %) a **94\u201395 %** (c\u00edl 95 %) u v\u0161ech t\u0159\u00ed model\u016f, obou stanic a v\u0161ech horizont\u016f.\n- **Slabina z\u016fst\u00e1v\u00e1 na vzestupu:** kdy\u017e hladina za horizont stoupne aspo\u0148 o 50 cm, 80% p\u00e1smo pokr\u00fdv\u00e1 59\u201372 % hodin, na\n  za\u010d\u00e1tku vzestupu 60\u201369 %, 95% p\u00e1smo 82\u201391 %. Model za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu podce\u0148uje a z toho, co je zn\u00e1m\u00e9 v \u010dase vyd\u00e1n\u00ed,\n  se to ned\u00e1 poznat (zkou\u0161eno: trend za 6 h, v\u00fd\u0161ka hladiny, pr\u016ftok v M\u011bln\u00edku, posledn\u00ed ov\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 chyba).\n- **Rekordn\u00ed povode\u0148 6/2013** je mimo rozsah: 80% p\u00e1smo 42 % hodin, 95% p\u00e1smo 66 %. Nejhor\u0161\u00ed povode\u0148 m\u00e1 u ka\u017ed\u00e9ho\n  modelu pokryt\u00ed 36\u201354 % (80 %).\n- **Na modelu, kter\u00fd aplikace pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 pro p\u0159ehr\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed** (Ridge u\u010den\u00fd do 2018), je nov\u00e9 80% p\u00e1smo na nevid\u011bn\u00fdch valida\u010dn\u00edch\n  povodn\u00edch opatrn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed, ne\u017e mus\u00ed: 84\u201388 %, v klidu 2019\u20132020 86\u201394 %. Pro \u201eDne\u0161ek\u201c (model u\u010den\u00fd do 2025) se to ov\u011b\u0159it\n  ned\u00e1.\n- \u0160\u00ed\u0159ka 80% p\u00e1sma (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h): t\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge 47 cm, Ridge 30 46 cm, **G3 43 cm** (nejp\u0159esn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed model m\u00e1 neju\u017e\u0161\u00ed\n  p\u00e1smo p\u0159i stejn\u00e9m pokryt\u00ed). Dne\u0161n\u00ed t\u00fdmov\u00e9 p\u00e1smo m\u00e1 32 cm, ale netref\u00ed se do n\u011bj t\u0159etina hodin.\n\n## Metoda\n\n1. **P\u0159edpov\u011bdi mimo tr\u00e9nink** (`oof.py`): leave-one-flood-out p\u0159es 22 povodn\u00ed 2006\u20132020 se stejn\u00fdmi foldy jako ostatn\u00ed\n   (`kandidati/lofo_foldy.csv`): fold dr\u017e\u00ed okno povodn\u011b (7 dn\u00ed p\u0159ed a\u017e 5 dn\u00ed po vrcholu) a z tr\u00e9ninku vy\u0159ad\u00ed okno\n   \u00b1 20 dn\u00ed. Pro \u00dast\u00ed stejn\u00e9 \u010dasy oken. T\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge a Ridge 30 ze sou\u010dt\u016f (shoda se sklearn 6\u00b710\u207b\u2079 cm), LightGBM 30\n   p\u0159esn\u011b jako uvnit\u0159 `g3.py` (p\u0159\u00edsn\u00e1 doba dob\u011bhu), G3 = \u00bd + \u00bd. Kontrola: LOFO D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h 15,29 / 14,79 / 13,91 cm\n   (Danovy v\u00fdsledky 15,29 / 14,79 / 13,94; LightGBM 30 16,05 proti 16,06).\n2. **Chyba** e = skute\u010dnost \u2212 p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f. **Skupiny** podle toho, co je zn\u00e1m\u00e9 v \u010dase vyd\u00e1n\u00ed: p\u0159edpov\u011bzen\u00e1 zm\u011bna\n   d = p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f \u2212 stav te\u010f v 6 p\u00e1smech (\u2264 \u2212P, \u2212P a\u017e \u2212P/3, \u00b1P/3, P/3 a\u017e P, P a\u017e 2P, \u2265 2P; P = 10 / 20 / 30 cm pro\n   12 / 24 / 36 h). V ka\u017ed\u00e9 skupin\u011b doln\u00ed a horn\u00ed kvantil chyb (po\u0159ad\u00ed s opravou n + 1), p\u00e1smo = [p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f + doln\u00ed,\n   p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f + horn\u00ed], tedy nesymetrick\u00e9. Skupina s m\u00e9n\u011b ne\u017e 200 hodinami dostane kvantily ze v\u0161ech chyb.\n3. **Vno\u0159en\u00e9 ov\u011b\u0159en\u00ed** (`overeni.py`): p\u00e1smo povodn\u011b k jen z chyb povodn\u00ed mimo jej\u00ed blok (14 blok\u016f: povodn\u011b, jejich\u017e\n   mezery \u00b1 20 dn\u00ed se p\u0159ekr\u00fdvaj\u00ed, nap\u0159. 12/2012 a 1/2013, jejich\u017e okna sd\u00edlej\u00ed 48 h). Pokryt\u00ed, \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka a intervalov\u00e9 sk\u00f3re\n   (\u0161\u00ed\u0159ka + 2/\u03b1 \u00d7 o kolik skute\u010dnost p\u00e1smo minula) po povodn\u00edch, po re\u017eimech v \u010dase vyd\u00e1n\u00ed a po skute\u010dn\u00e9m v\u00fdvoji.\n4. **V\u00fdb\u011br varianty** p\u0159edem dan\u00fdm pravidlem: nejmen\u0161\u00ed pr\u016fm\u011brn\u00e9 intervalov\u00e9 sk\u00f3re, pokud pokryt\u00ed nikde neklesne o v\u00edc\n   ne\u017e 3 p. b. pod c\u00edl. Varianty: jedno p\u00e1smo pro v\u0161e 128,4, trend za 6 h 123,7, vzestup/pokles/klid 121,4, tot\u00e9\u017e \u00d7 v\u00fd\u0161ka\n   124,4, **6 p\u00e1sem zm\u011bny 120,0** (vybran\u00e1). U t\u00fdmov\u00e9ho Ridge samotn\u00e9ho: nov\u00e9 125, dne\u0161n\u00ed t\u00fdmov\u00e9 167. Mimo pravidlo zkou\u0161eno a zam\u00edtnuto: sign\u00e1l z M\u011bln\u00edka\n   a posledn\u00ed ov\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 chyba (hor\u0161\u00ed sk\u00f3re i pokryt\u00ed p\u0159i vzestupu). V\u00fdb\u011br i hodnocen\u00ed jsou na stejn\u00fdch povodn\u00edch, rozd\u00edly\n   mezi variantami jsou ale mal\u00e9 (do 7 %).\n5. **Kvantily pro aplikaci** (`kvantily.json`) ze v\u0161ech 22 povodn\u00ed, s po\u010dtem hodin a povodn\u00ed za ka\u017edou skupinou.\n6. **P\u0159\u00edsn\u00e1 kontrola** (`prisne.py`): modely ostatn\u00edch povodn\u00ed p\u0159i oby\u010dejn\u00e9m LOFO povode\u0148 k vid\u011bly. U Ridge a Ridge 30\n   jsou chyby pro kalibraci znovu spo\u010d\u00edtan\u00e9 modely bez cel\u00e9ho bloku povodn\u011b k. V\u00fdsledek (pr\u016fm\u011br p\u0159es oba Ridge,\n   c\u00edle a horizonty): 80% p\u00e1smo 79,4 % p\u0159\u00edsn\u011b proti 78,9 % oby\u010dejn\u011b, \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka 54,3 proti 54,0 cm, rychl\u00fd vzestup 66,8\n   proti 66,5 %; 95% p\u00e1smo 94,2 proti 94,0 %. Oby\u010dejn\u00e9 vno\u0159en\u00ed tedy pokryt\u00ed nep\u0159ikra\u0161luje (`vysledky/prisne_vnorene.csv`).\n\n## V\u00fdsledky (vno\u0159en\u011b po bloc\u00edch, 22 povodn\u00ed 2006\u20132020)\n\nPokryt\u00ed v % hodin, \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka p\u00e1sma v cm. \u201eRychl\u00fd vzestup\u201c = za horizont stoupne aspo\u0148 o 50 cm, \u201eza\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu\u201c = nav\u00edc\nposledn\u00edch 6 h stouplo m\u00e9n\u011b ne\u017e o 10 cm. Dne\u0161n\u00ed t\u00fdmov\u00e9 = p\u00e1smo z `src/nejistota.py` stejn\u00e9 \u00farovn\u011b.\n\n### P\u00e1smo 80 %\n\n| model | c\u00edl | h | pokryt\u00ed | \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka | rychl\u00fd vzestup | za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu | pokles | nejhor\u0161\u00ed povode\u0148 | dne\u0161n\u00ed t\u00fdmov\u00e9 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Ridge (t\u00fdm) | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 12 | 79 | 25 | 61 | 61 | 74 | 41 | 72 |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 24 | 80 | 47 | 69 | 60 | 77 | 42 | 66 |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 36 | 79 | 84 | 71 | 63 | 75 | 53 | 58 |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 12 | 79 | 30 | 64 | 61 | 73 | 40 | 71 |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 24 | 79 | 54 | 69 | 63 | 76 | 49 | 65 |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 36 | 79 | 90 | 70 | 62 | 75 | 54 | 59 |\n| Ridge 30 | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 12 | 79 | 26 | 59 | 69 | 74 | 42 | |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 24 | 79 | 46 | 66 | 66 | 76 | 40 | |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 36 | 78 | 79 | 69 | 66 | 76 | 47 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 12 | 79 | 30 | 63 | 65 | 74 | 40 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 24 | 79 | 51 | 66 | 66 | 76 | 40 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 36 | 79 | 86 | 71 | 67 | 76 | 43 | |\n| G3 | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 12 | 79 | 25 | 65 | 68 | 75 | 39 | |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 24 | 79 | 43 | 70 | 66 | 77 | 36 | |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 36 | 79 | 78 | 72 | 68 | 76 | 41 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 12 | 79 | 28 | 67 | 64 | 75 | 43 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 24 | 79 | 48 | 70 | 67 | 77 | 46 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 36 | 79 | 86 | 71 | 67 | 75 | 46 | |\n\n### P\u00e1smo 95 %\n\n| model | c\u00edl | h | pokryt\u00ed | \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka | rychl\u00fd vzestup | za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu | pokles | nejhor\u0161\u00ed povode\u0148 | dne\u0161n\u00ed t\u00fdmov\u00e9 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Ridge (t\u00fdm) | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 12 | 94 | 51 | 83 | 88 | 92 | 64 | 90 |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 24 | 94 | 94 | 87 | 82 | 92 | 66 | 85 |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 36 | 94 | 147 | 90 | 88 | 91 | 75 | 81 |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 12 | 94 | 61 | 83 | 86 | 91 | 57 | 89 |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 24 | 94 | 106 | 88 | 85 | 91 | 64 | 85 |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 36 | 94 | 161 | 91 | 89 | 90 | 78 | 81 |\n| Ridge 30 | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 12 | 94 | 54 | 82 | 88 | 92 | 60 | |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 24 | 94 | 92 | 87 | 84 | 92 | 56 | |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 36 | 94 | 140 | 89 | 88 | 92 | 72 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 12 | 94 | 63 | 84 | 86 | 91 | 54 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 24 | 94 | 104 | 88 | 84 | 91 | 61 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 36 | 94 | 152 | 90 | 88 | 90 | 75 | |\n| G3 | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 12 | 95 | 46 | 87 | 88 | 92 | 69 | |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 24 | 94 | 84 | 87 | 84 | 93 | 62 | |\n| | D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 36 | 94 | 139 | 89 | 89 | 91 | 57 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 12 | 94 | 54 | 84 | 85 | 92 | 61 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 24 | 94 | 93 | 89 | 86 | 92 | 65 | |\n| | \u00dast\u00ed | 36 | 94 | 149 | 90 | 89 | 91 | 69 | |\n\nPr\u016fm\u011br p\u0159es c\u00edle a horizonty (80 %): t\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge pokryt\u00ed 79,1 %, \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka 55 cm, rychl\u00fd vzestup 67 %, za\u010d\u00e1tek 62 %,\npokles 75 %, klid 86 %; Ridge 30 78,8 / 53 / 66 / 66 %; G3 79,2 / 51 / 69 / 67 %. Dne\u0161n\u00ed t\u00fdmov\u00e9 65,2 % / 32 cm /\n27 % / 15 %. Po povodn\u00edch a po re\u017eimech: `vysledky/pokryti_povodne.csv`, `vysledky/pokryti_rezimy.csv`.\n\nPo povodn\u00edch (t\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge, D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h): 80% p\u00e1smo pokr\u00fdv\u00e1 u 19 z 22 povodn\u00ed 74\u201393 % hodin, hor\u0161\u00ed jsou 6/2009 (63 %),\n8/2010 (62 %) a 6/2013 (42 %). 95% p\u00e1smo u 18 z 22 povodn\u00ed 93\u2013100 %, hor\u0161\u00ed 8/2010 (81 %), 9/2010 (86 %), 6/2013 (66 %)\na druh\u00e1 vlna 6/2013 (86 %). Na vrcholu rekordn\u00ed povodn\u011b model \u010dek\u00e1 malou zm\u011bnu, tak\u017ee p\u00e1smo je \u00fazk\u00e9, a skute\u010dnost le\u017e\u00ed\na\u017e 100 cm nad n\u00edm (`grafy/pasmo_2013-06-05.png`).\n\n### Model aplikace na nevid\u011bn\u00fdch datech\n\nRidge u\u010den\u00fd na tr\u00e9novac\u00ed \u010d\u00e1sti 2006\u20132018 (jako `app/predikce.py`), p\u00e1smo nov\u00e9 metody, validace t\u00fdmov\u00e9ho splitu\n(4 povodn\u011b: kvantily bez bloku t\u00e9 povodn\u011b; klid 2019\u20132020: kvantily ze v\u0161ech 22 povodn\u00ed):\n\n| c\u00edl | h | 80 %: povodn\u011b | 80 %: klid 2019\u20132020 | 95 %: povodn\u011b | 95 %: klid | \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka 80 % povodn\u011b / klid (cm) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 12 | 84 | 88 | 96 | 98 | 25 / 21 |\n| D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 24 | 84 | 86 | 97 | 98 | 47 / 36 |\n| D\u011b\u010d\u00edn | 36 | 85 | 92 | 98 | 99 | 86 / 69 |\n| \u00dast\u00ed | 12 | 85 | 88 | 97 | 98 | 29 / 24 |\n| \u00dast\u00ed | 24 | 87 | 86 | 97 | 98 | 56 / 42 |\n| \u00dast\u00ed | 36 | 88 | 94 | 99 | 99 | 94 / 77 |\n\nP\u00e1smo je kalibrovan\u00e9 na oknech povodn\u00ed, proto je v klidu zbyte\u010dn\u011b \u0161irok\u00e9 (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h 36 cm, i kdy\u017e se hladina skoro\nneh\u00fdbe). Model u\u010den\u00fd do 2018 je na validaci o n\u011bco p\u0159esn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e LOFO modely na \u201et\u011b\u017ek\u00fdch\u201c povodn\u00edch, odtud pokryt\u00ed nad\nc\u00edlem. Pro \u201eDne\u0161ek\u201c (u\u010den\u00fd do 2025) chyb\u00ed nevid\u011bn\u00e1 data, p\u00e1smo tam je odhad.\n\n## Grafy (`grafy/`, sv\u011btl\u00e9, na projektor, styl slajd\u016f t\u00fdmu)\n\n- `pokryti.png`: pokryt\u00ed 80% p\u00e1sma, dne\u0161n\u00ed t\u00fdmov\u00e9 proti nov\u00e9mu, celkem a p\u0159i rychl\u00e9m vzestupu.\n- `pasmo_2011-01-16.png`: leden 2011 (v\u00fdchoz\u00ed obrazovka aplikace), skute\u010dnost v 80% p\u00e1smu 78 % hodin, v 95% 98 %.\n- `pasmo_2010-09-28.png`: z\u00e1\u0159\u00ed 2010, d\u00e9\u0161\u0165 nad D\u011b\u010d\u00ednem, 81 % / 86 %: vzestup p\u0159ijde rychleji, ne\u017e model \u010dek\u00e1.\n- `pasmo_2013-06-05.png`: \u010derven 2013, rekordn\u00ed povode\u0148, 42 % / 66 %: p\u00e1smo je moc \u00fazk\u00e9.\n\nP\u00e1smo v grafech je vno\u0159en\u00e9 (bez t\u00e9to povodn\u011b a sousedn\u00edch), ukazuje tedy, co by aplikace tehdy opravdu nab\u00eddla.\n\n## Pro aplikaci\n\n`nejistota_dan.pasmo(model, cil, horizont, pred, hladina_ted, hladina_pred_6h, uroven=0.8)` vr\u00e1t\u00ed (doln\u00ed, horn\u00ed) v cm,\npro \u010d\u00edslo i pole; `model` je `ridge` (i `ridge_vse`), `ridge30` nebo `g3`. Chyb\u011bj\u00edc\u00ed vstup d\u00e1 NaN, ne zd\u00e1nliv\u011b platn\u00e9\np\u00e1smo. Kvantily v `kvantily.json`. Napojen\u00ed do aplikace je jako n\u00e1vrh v `patche/01_pasmo_nejistoty.patch` (aplikace\nv main se nem\u011bn\u00ed): `interval()` v `app/predikce.py` zavol\u00e1 `pasmo()` se stavem p\u0159ed 6 h z \u0159\u00e1dku vstup\u016f, popisky \u201e90 %\nchyb na tr\u00e9ninku\u201c se zm\u011bn\u00ed na \u201e8 z 10 p\u0159\u00edpad\u016f (ov\u011b\u0159eno na 22 povodn\u00edch)\u201c.\n\n## Slabiny a co by se dalo d\u00e1l\n\n- **Pokryt\u00ed je empirick\u00e9, ne zaru\u010den\u00e9.** Hodiny jedn\u00e9 povodn\u011b nejsou nez\u00e1visl\u00e9 a chyby jsou z 22 r\u016fzn\u00fdch model\u016f;\n  nez\u00e1visl\u00fdch \u201epozorov\u00e1n\u00ed\u201c je ve skute\u010dnosti 22 povodn\u00ed (14 blok\u016f), ne 6 358 hodin.\n- **Vzestup:** 80% p\u00e1smo pokr\u00fdv\u00e1 59\u201372 %. Lep\u0161\u00ed by bylo p\u00e1smo podm\u00edn\u011bn\u00e9 sr\u00e1\u017ekovou p\u0159edpov\u011bd\u00ed nebo stavem horn\u00edch\n  stanic, kter\u00e9 model zat\u00edm nevid\u00ed; sign\u00e1l z M\u011bln\u00edka ani posledn\u00ed chyba nepomohly.\n- **Rekordn\u00ed povodn\u011b** (6/2013) jsou mimo rozsah 21 ostatn\u00edch povodn\u00ed, p\u00e1smo je tam moc \u00fazk\u00e9. V aplikaci by se p\u0159i\n  hladin\u011b nad historick\u00fdm rozsahem m\u011blo ps\u00e1t, \u017ee p\u00e1smo neplat\u00ed.\n- **G3:** oby\u010dejn\u00e9 LOFO (modely ostatn\u00edch povodn\u00ed vid\u011bly povode\u0148 k); p\u0159\u00edsn\u00e1 kontrola je jen pro Ridge, kde vy\u0161la skoro\n  stejn\u011b. LightGBM v G3 m\u00e1 t\u00fdmov\u00e9 doby dob\u011bhu (`lgbm_a.DOBA`) odhadnut\u00e9 na t\u00fdmov\u00e9m tr\u00e9ninku, kter\u00fd \u010d\u00e1st povodn\u00ed obsahuje;\n  to je vlastnost modelu, ne p\u00e1sma.\n- **\u00dast\u00ed** se hodnot\u00ed na oknech d\u011b\u010d\u00ednsk\u00fdch povodn\u00ed (tyt\u00e9\u017e ud\u00e1losti), klidn\u00e9 obdob\u00ed mimo povodn\u011b jen na validaci 2019\u20132020.\n- **Klid:** p\u00e1smo je v klidu zbyte\u010dn\u011b \u0161irok\u00e9 (kalibrace jen z oken povodn\u00ed).\n\nOt\u00e1zka poroty a odpov\u011b\u010f: \u201eJak v\u00edte, \u017ee rozmez\u00ed \u201enejsp\u00ed\u0161 690 a\u017e 790 cm\u201c plat\u00ed?\u201c \u2013 Ov\u011b\u0159ili jsme ho na 22 povodn\u00edch tak,\n\u017ee pro ka\u017edou povode\u0148 jsme p\u00e1smo spo\u010d\u00edtali jen z ostatn\u00edch, jako by ji model ani p\u00e1smo nikdy nevid\u011bly. Skute\u010dnost padla\ndo 80% p\u00e1sma v 79\u201380 % hodin. P\u0159i rychl\u00e9m vzestupu jen asi v 2 ze 3 p\u0159\u00edpad\u016f a na rekordn\u00ed povodni 2013 ve 4 z 10,\nto \u0159\u00edk\u00e1me otev\u0159en\u011b.\n", "origin/dan-nejistota:nejistota_dan/REVIZE_APLIKACE.md": "# Revize aplikace (app/, Honza) p\u0159ed demem\n\nDan, so 24. 10. 2026 02:00\u201304:00, stav `origin/main` 59956c9. Aplikaci v main jsem nem\u011bnil. Opravy jsou jako n\u00e1vrhy\nv `patche/01.patch` \u2026 `09.patch`: ka\u017ed\u00fd jde aplikovat samostatn\u011b i v\u0161echny po sob\u011b (`git apply nejistota_dan/patche/NN.patch`\nz ko\u0159ene repa) a se v\u0161emi pro\u0161el `python app/test_app.py --dnesek` (10 z 10). Zdroje n\u00e1lez\u016f: nez\u00e1visl\u00e1 statick\u00e1 revize\nk\u00f3du, nez\u00e1visl\u00e1 revize Codexem (`codex/kontrola_b_aplikace.md`) a vlastn\u00ed spu\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed. Ka\u017ed\u00fd n\u00e1lez n\u00ed\u017e jsem ov\u011b\u0159il v k\u00f3du.\n\n## Co jsem spustil\n\n- `python app/test_app.py`: na \u010dist\u00e9m stavu (modely nejsou v Gitu, aplikace si je natr\u00e9nuje) **9 z 9 OK**,\n  prvn\u00ed na\u010dten\u00ed **23,5 s** (README slibuje asi 10 s; po\u010d\u00edta\u010d byl vyt\u00ed\u017een\u00fd), druh\u00e9 7 s. S `--dnesek` **10 z 10**,\n  Dne\u0161ek s internetem 16\u201321 s (stahuje 48 soubor\u016f \u010cHM\u00da).\n- Simulovan\u00e1 \u201evis\u00edc\u00ed\u201c Wi-Fi (proxy na nedosa\u017eitelnou adresu): Dne\u0161ek \u010dekal **42 s**, ne\u017e uk\u00e1zal srozumitelnou chybu,\n  a to u\u017e m\u011bl ulo\u017een\u00e9 soubory recent/; na \u010dist\u00e9m klonu by stahoval 4\u00d7 v\u00edc soubor\u016f (\u0159\u00e1dov\u011b 2\u20133 minuty).\n- V\u00fdchoz\u00ed obrazovka D\u011b\u010d\u00edn 15. 1. 2011 9:00: te\u010f 646 cm, za 12 / 24 / 36 h 705 / 738 / 756 cm, skute\u010dnost pak byla\n  685 / 703 / 724 cm. Dne\u0161n\u00ed p\u00e1smo \u201enejsp\u00ed\u0161\u201c 712\u2013794 cm na 24 h skute\u010dnost **mine** (703), nov\u00e9 80% p\u00e1smo 708\u2013794 taky\n  (t\u011bsn\u011b). Prezentuj\u00edc\u00ed by to m\u011bl v\u011bd\u011bt (viz V4).\n- \u010c\u00edsla v aplikaci proti `docs/PREHLED.md`: validace 17,1 cm (pr\u016fm\u011br 6 kombinac\u00ed), D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h 15,5 cm, test 22,4 cm,\n  D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h na testu 17,5 cm, 2. stupe\u0148 3 z 4, 12 h, 1 plan\u00fd: **sed\u00ed**. Nesed\u00ed texty o tom, z jak\u00e9ho modelu jsou\n  p\u0159edpov\u011bdi Borise (V1), a popisek tabulky testu (V2).\n\n## Kritick\u00e9 (m\u016f\u017ee shodit nebo zkazit demo)\n\n**K1. Bez internetu jsou Mapa a Animace pr\u00e1zdn\u00fd tmav\u00fd obd\u00e9ln\u00edk bez vysv\u011btlen\u00ed.** `animace.py:29, 271` (deck.gl\nz unpkg.com), `mapbox_mapa.py:28, 251` (mapbox-gl z api.mapbox.com); i bez tokenu pot\u0159ebuje mapa dla\u017edice\nOpenStreetMap a v\u00fd\u0161ky z AWS (`mapa.py`). Slajd 9 a video Borise p\u0159itom stoj\u00ed pr\u00e1v\u011b na map\u011b. README to \u0159\u00edk\u00e1\n(\u201eMapa a animace bez n\u011bj pou\u017eiteln\u00e9 nejsou\u201c), na obrazovce ale porota uvid\u00ed jen pr\u00e1zdno.\n- Patch `02.patch`: kdy\u017e se knihovna nena\u010dte, iframe uk\u00e1\u017ee v\u011btu \u201eAnimace / Mapa pot\u0159ebuje internet\u2026 pus\u0165te z\u00e1lo\u017en\u00ed video\u201c.\n- Mimo k\u00f3d: **z\u00e1lo\u017en\u00ed video** a hotspot z mobilu; p\u0159ed porotou proj\u00edt v\u0161echny z\u00e1lo\u017eky (na\u010dtou se dla\u017edice).\n\n**K2. Dne\u0161ek na \u0161patn\u00e9 Wi-Fi zamrzne na minuty, chybu si pamatuje 10 minut a rozbit\u00fd soubor ulo\u017e\u00ed natrvalo.**\n- `aktualni.py:39`: 48 po\u017eadavk\u016f, ka\u017ed\u00fd s timeoutem 30 s, str\u00e1nka mezit\u00edm jen \u201eRunning\u2026\u201c.\n- `app.py:76`: `@st.cache_data(ttl=600)` si pamatuje i ne\u00fasp\u011bch (`ok=False`); kdy\u017e se s\u00ed\u0165 vr\u00e1t\u00ed, Dne\u0161ek d\u00e1l 10 minut hl\u00e1s\u00ed\n  chybu a p\u0159epnut\u00ed tla\u010d\u00edtka nepom\u016f\u017ee (potvrdil i Codex).\n- `aktualni.py:43\u201345`: soubor se zap\u00ed\u0161e na disk d\u0159\u00edv, ne\u017e se ov\u011b\u0159\u00ed, \u017ee je to JSON. Na Wi-Fi s p\u0159ihla\u0161ovac\u00ed str\u00e1nkou se\n  do `data/raw/chmu_aktualni/recent_*.json` ulo\u017e\u00ed HTML a Dne\u0161ek je rozbit\u00fd, dokud n\u011bkdo slo\u017eku nesma\u017ee.\n- Patch `03.patch`: timeout (5, 15) s, na disk jen platn\u00fd JSON, rozbit\u00fd soubor se sma\u017ee a st\u00e1hne znovu, spinner\n  \u201eStahuji \u017eiv\u00e1 data \u010cHM\u00da\u2026\u201c, po chyb\u011b `dnes_c.clear()`, Open-Meteo timeout (5, 10).\n- Mimo k\u00f3d: Dne\u0161ek p\u0159ed porotou jednou zapnout (soubory recent/ se ulo\u017e\u00ed, dal\u0161\u00ed na\u010dten\u00ed je rychl\u00e9).\n\n## Vysok\u00e9 (\u0161patn\u00e9 \u010d\u00edslo nebo matouc\u00ed text)\n\n**V1. U Borise aplikace p\u00ed\u0161e \u201eP\u0159edpov\u011bdi jsou z modelu u\u010den\u00e9ho do roku 2018\u201c, ale jsou z modelu u\u010den\u00e9ho do 2020**\n(`app.py:243`; `results/predpovedi/ridge_test.parquet` vyrobil `porovnej.py --test` s `finalni=True`, PREHLED:\n\u201enatr\u00e9novan\u00fd na v\u0161em do 2020\u201c). Mapa \u201eCel\u00e1 povode\u0148\u201c a Animace u Borise ale opravdu po\u010d\u00edtaj\u00ed model `ridge` do 2018,\ntak\u017ee d\u00e1vaj\u00ed trochu jin\u00e1 \u010d\u00edsla ne\u017e slajd (vrchol 611 cm, 27 h). **Video Borise se nahr\u00e1v\u00e1 z mapy, ne z testu.**\n- Patch `04.patch` oprav\u00ed text. Video: p\u0159ed nahr\u00e1n\u00edm porovnat hodnotu u vrcholu v map\u011b s 611 cm, p\u0159\u00edpadn\u011b \u0159\u00edct,\n  \u017ee video je z modelu do 2018.\n\n**V2. U Borise tabulka ukazuje cel\u00fd test 2021\u20132025, ne Borise, a popisek tvrd\u00ed \u201epr\u016fm\u011br p\u0159es 4 povodn\u011b\u201c**\n(`app.py:266\u2013280`). Prop\u00e1snut\u00fd 2. stupe\u0148 v tabulce je \u00fanor 2024, ne Boris. Patch `04.patch`: popisek rozli\u0161\u00ed validaci\na test a \u0159ekne, \u017ee p\u0159edstih je nejv\u00fd\u0161 horizont a prop\u00e1snut\u00e1 povode\u0148 = 0.\n\n**V3. Text pod Mapbox mapou popisuje \u00fa\u0159edn\u00ed z\u00e1plavov\u00e1 \u00fazem\u00ed (DIBAVOD), mapa ale ukazuje rozliv z v\u00fd\u0161kov\u00e9ho modelu\n(\u010c\u00daZK DMR 5G)** (`app.py:293\u2013296, 339\u2013342`; `mapbox_mapa.py:403` v\u00fdchoz\u00ed `uredni: false`). Patch `04.patch`.\n\n**V4. P\u00e1smo \u201enejsp\u00ed\u0161\u201c slibuje v\u00edc, ne\u017e plat\u00ed, a na v\u00fdchoz\u00ed obrazovce ho skute\u010dnost mine.** Popisek (`app.py:228`)\n\u201e90 % chyb na tr\u00e9ninku; na povodn\u00edch\u2026 asi 8 z 10\u201c: vno\u0159en\u00e1 kontrola na 22 povodn\u00edch (`ZPRAVA_NEJISTOTA.md`) d\u00e1v\u00e1\ndne\u0161n\u00edmu p\u00e1smu na povodn\u00edch 59\u201372 % a na za\u010d\u00e1tku vzestupu 15 %.\n- Patch `01.patch` napoj\u00ed nov\u00e9 p\u00e1smo (`nejistota_dan.pasmo`, 80 %, ov\u011b\u0159en\u00e9 79\u201380 % na povodn\u00edch, p\u0159i rychl\u00e9m vzestupu\n  ~2 ze 3) a oprav\u00ed popisky. Pot\u0159ebuje slou\u010dit `nejistota_dan/` z v\u011btve `dan-nejistota` (modul + `kvantily.json`);\n  bez n\u011bj aplikace z\u016fstane u star\u00e9ho p\u00e1sma, nic nespadne.\n- Patch `09.patch` (voliteln\u00fd): p\u0159i p\u0159ehr\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed historie te\u010dkovan\u011b dokresl\u00ed, co pak opravdu nastalo, tak\u017ee porota vid\u00ed,\n  jak p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f dopadla. Na v\u00fdchoz\u00ed obrazovce bude vid\u011bt, \u017ee model o 20\u201335 cm p\u0159est\u0159elil, to je poctiv\u00e9 a d\u00e1 se na\n  tom vysv\u011btlit p\u00e1smo.\n- Prezentuj\u00edc\u00ed: \u201eza 24 h model \u0159\u00edkal 738 cm, skute\u010dnost byla 703 cm, p\u00e1smo to skoro zachyt\u00ed\u201c.\n\n**V5. Dne\u0161ek po\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 s modelem `ridge` u\u010den\u00fdm do 2018, ne s `ridge_vse` (do 2025), a `ridge_vse` p\u0159i p\u0159ehr\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed\nhistorie p\u0159edpov\u00edd\u00e1 povodn\u011b, na kter\u00fdch se u\u010dil** (`app.py:135\u2013151`; potvrdil i Codex). Patch `05.patch`: Dne\u0161ek\npou\u017eije `ridge_vse`, v\u00fdb\u011br `ridge_vse` v historii uk\u00e1\u017ee varov\u00e1n\u00ed.\n\n**V6. Animace a mapa \u201eCel\u00e1 povode\u0148\u201c se spust\u00ed v z\u00e1lo\u017ece, kterou nikdo nevid\u00ed** (`animace.py:596`, `mapbox_mapa.py:836`:\n`hraje = true`; Streamlit vykresl\u00ed v\u0161echny z\u00e1lo\u017eky hned) a rozvr\u017een\u00ed po\u010d\u00edtan\u00e9 z `innerWidth` m\u016f\u017ee v neviditeln\u00e9m iframu\nvyj\u00edt z nuly (z\u00e1b\u011br odd\u00e1len\u00fd). Patch `06.patch`: start po kliknut\u00ed na P\u0159ehr\u00e1t, `innerWidth || 1270`. Ov\u011b\u0159it ru\u010dn\u011b\nv prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010di (AppTest JavaScript nespou\u0161t\u00ed).\n\n## St\u0159edn\u00ed\n\n- **S1. `.env` v jin\u00e9m k\u00f3dov\u00e1n\u00ed shod\u00ed celou aplikaci** (`mapa.py:37`: `read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")`; PowerShell 5.1\n  `echo \u2026 > .env` d\u011bl\u00e1 UTF-16). Patch `07.patch` (`utf-8-sig`, `errors=\"replace\"`, mezery, uvozovky). Na Macu `.env`\n  d\u011blat v Termin\u00e1lu, ne v TextEditu (RTF).\n- **S2. Pomal\u00fd start a kop\u00edrov\u00e1n\u00ed 133 MB tabulky p\u0159i ka\u017ed\u00e9 akci** (`app.py:42`: `@st.cache_data` vrac\u00ed kopii; vol\u00e1 se\n  3\u00d7 p\u0159i ka\u017ed\u00e9m kliknut\u00ed). Patch `08.patch` (`@st.cache_resource`, tabulku nikdo nem\u011bn\u00ed). P\u0159ed demem\n  `python src/uloz_model.py` a `--vse`, aplikaci jednou otev\u0159\u00edt a server nerestartovat.\n- **S3. Instalace na Macu:** `requirements.txt` m\u00e1 jen doln\u00ed meze (`streamlit>=1.60`), `styl.py` c\u00edl\u00ed CSS p\u0159es\n  `data-testid`, nov\u00e1 verze Streamlitu m\u016f\u017ee vzhled rozb\u00edt; vyzkou\u0161eno se Streamlit 1.66.1, plotly 7.1.0, pydeck 0.9.3.\n  Prost\u0159ed\u00ed na Tobiasov\u011b Macu p\u0159ipravit a vyzkou\u0161et p\u0159edem (instalace pot\u0159ebuje internet). Python z Xcode je 3.9,\n  README chce 3.10+. Prvn\u00ed `streamlit run` se pt\u00e1 na e-mail: `--server.headless true` nebo Enter.\n- **S4. Hranice star\u00e9ho p\u00e1sma nesed\u00ed s kalibrac\u00ed** (`predikce.py:74` bere `hladina >= hranice`, `src/nejistota.py`\n  `pd.cut` uzav\u0159en\u00e9 zprava): p\u0159i hladin\u011b p\u0159esn\u011b 300, 450 nebo 600 cm aplikace vezme sousedn\u00ed p\u00e1smo (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h\n  p\u0159i 450 cm \u221237/+9 m\u00edsto \u221219/+19 cm). Patch `01.patch` to obch\u00e1z\u00ed (nov\u00e9 p\u00e1smo), jinak opravit na `>`.\n- **S5. Rozliv z v\u00fd\u0161kov\u00e9ho modelu se uk\u00e1\u017ee i pod spo\u010dten\u00fdm rozsahem** (`mapbox_mapa.py:73`: na za\u010d\u00e1tku Borise kolem\n  150 cm se vezme polygon pro 300 cm a \u201epod vodou X ha\u201c). Oprava: `if (h < U[0].h - 10) return -1;` (bez patche,\n  pot\u0159ebuje vyzkou\u0161et v prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010di).\n- **S6. Tla\u010d\u00edtko \u201eP\u0159ehr\u00e1t povode\u0148 1/2011\u201c** (`app.py:329`) blokuje str\u00e1nku 40\u201360 s, s tokenem p\u0159epne z Mapboxu na\n  pydeck a mapa blik\u00e1; tot\u00e9\u017e l\u00e9pe d\u011bl\u00e1 \u201eCel\u00e1 povode\u0148\u201c. Doporu\u010den\u00ed: na demu nema\u010dkat (nebo uk\u00e1zat jen bez tokenu).\n- **S7. Projektor:** iframy 700\u2013720 px (li\u0161ta animace pod okrajem na 1280\u00d7720), drobn\u00e9 popisky 11\u201313,6 px na tmav\u00e9m\n  pozad\u00ed, p\u00edsma z Google Fonts (bez s\u00edt\u011b se vezme syst\u00e9mov\u00e9). Zkusit zoom prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010de 125 % a \u201eCel\u00e1 obrazovka\u201c v map\u011b.\n\n## N\u00edzk\u00e9\n\n- Den v menu ve form\u00e1tu 2011/01/15, jinde 15. 1. 2011; \u201e1.3 h\u201c s te\u010dkou; \u201e1000 m\u00b3/s\u201c bez mezery (`app.py:178`).\n- Den a hodina v menu aktivn\u00ed i v Dne\u0161ku, kde se nepou\u017eij\u00ed; n\u00e1zvy model\u016f `ridge` / `ridge_vse` laik nepochop\u00ed\n  (`format_func`).\n- `app.py:366`: popisek \u201e\u00a9 Mapbox, \u00a9 Maxar\u201c i bez tokenu, kdy jde o OSM a AWS.\n- `app.py:85`: hled\u00e1n\u00ed `*_ridge.json` by chytilo i `*_lgbm_c_ridge.json` (te\u010f n\u00e1hodou ne); p\u0159idat `z[\"model\"] == nazev`.\n- Zm\u011bna \u010dasu: 31. 10. 2010 2:00 jde vybrat jen jednou, jarn\u00ed neexistuj\u00edc\u00ed 2:00 se ti\u0161e posune.\n- V\u011bta \u201esr\u00e1\u017eky do modelu nevstupuj\u00ed\u201c se v Dne\u0161ku m\u016f\u017ee zobrazit dvakr\u00e1t.\n\n## Co vyzkou\u0161et ru\u010dn\u011b na Tobiasov\u011b Macu (AppTest to nepokryje)\n\n1. \u010cist\u00fd klon podle README: verze Pythonu, instalace, `uloz_model.py` i s `--vse`, prvn\u00ed na\u010dten\u00ed.\n2. `.env` z Termin\u00e1lu, satelitn\u00ed mapa; pak `.env` p\u0159ejmenovat, restartovat: mapa na OpenStreetMap, nic nespadne.\n3. Vypnout Wi-Fi a proj\u00edt v\u0161echny z\u00e1lo\u017eky: co je v Map\u011b a Animaci (s patchem 02 v\u011bta, bez n\u011bj pr\u00e1zdno). Dne\u0161ek bez s\u00edt\u011b:\n   jak dlouho \u010dek\u00e1; zapnout Wi-Fi a Dne\u0161ek znovu: nedr\u017e\u00ed se chyba (bez patche 03 dr\u017e\u00ed 10 minut).\n4. Mapa \u2192 Cel\u00e1 povode\u0148 \u2192 9/2024 \u2192 D\u011b\u010d\u00edn: hodnota u vrcholu proti slajdu (611 cm), a\u017e potom nahr\u00e1t video.\n5. Animaci otev\u0159\u00edt a\u017e po chv\u00edli na jin\u00e9 z\u00e1lo\u017ece: neb\u011b\u017e\u00ed u\u017e? Je z\u00e1b\u011br spr\u00e1vn\u011b p\u0159ibl\u00ed\u017een\u00fd?\n6. Projektor 1280\u00d7720 a 1920\u00d71080: li\u0161ta animace, \u010ditelnost, kole\u010dko my\u0161i nad mapou zoomuje m\u00edsto posunu str\u00e1nky.\n7. Safari i Chrome (WebGL, cel\u00e1 obrazovka).\n\n## Co m\u00e1 t\u00fdm r\u00e1no rozhodnout\n\n- Kter\u00e9 patche vz\u00edt do main (doporu\u010duji 02, 03, 04, 05, 07, 08 jako bezpe\u010dn\u00e9; 01 + `nejistota_dan/` jen kdy\u017e chce\n  t\u00fdm nov\u00e9 p\u00e1smo; 06 a 09 po ru\u010dn\u00edm vyzkou\u0161en\u00ed v prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010di).\n- Odkud je video Borise (mapa = model do 2018) a co p\u0159esn\u011b \u0159\u00edct ke \u201e27 h p\u0159edem\u201c.\n", "origin/dan-srazky:srazky_dan/ZPRAVA_SRAZKY.md": "# \u0160estihodinov\u00e9 sr\u00e1\u017eky ze synoptick\u00fdch stanic pro Labe v D\u011b\u010d\u00edn\u011b: zpr\u00e1va\n\nDan, v\u011btev `dan-srazky` (z `dan-ridge`), p\u00e1 23. 10. 2026 22:47 \u2013 so 0:55. Pr\u016fb\u011bh v `PRUBEH.md`, n\u00e1lezy Codexu\nv `NALEZY_CODEX.md`, v\u0161echny b\u011bhy ve `vysledky/srazky.jsonl` (CV a validace) a `vysledky/lofo.jsonl` (LOFO).\nTest 2021\u20132025 jsem nespou\u0161t\u011bl.\n\n## Shrnut\u00ed\n\n- Ot\u00e1zka: denn\u00ed sr\u00e1\u017eky \u010cHM\u00da nepomohly, proto\u017ee \u00fahrn sm\u00ed do modelu a\u017e dal\u0161\u00ed den v 07:00 UTC. \u0160estihodinov\u00e9 \u00fahrny\n  ze zpr\u00e1v SYNOP (NOAA ISD) jsou k dispozici hodinu po konci obdob\u00ed, tedy se zpo\u017ed\u011bn\u00edm 1\u20136 h.\n- **Verdikt: v\u0161echny t\u0159i modely \u201ebeze zm\u011bny\u201c** (zlep\u0161en\u00ed ani zhor\u0161en\u00ed od 1 cm na hlavn\u00edch \u010d\u00edslech CV povodn\u011b\n  a validace D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h). P\u0159\u00edsn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed LOFO p\u0159es 22 povodn\u00ed to potvrzuje: oba Ridge do 0,1 cm, LightGBM \u22120,5 cm\n  p\u0159i 13 zlep\u0161en\u00fdch z 22 povodn\u00ed, tak\u017ee ani jeden nespln\u00ed \u201e\u2265 1 cm a v\u011bt\u0161ina povodn\u00ed\u201c.\n- LightGBM jako jedin\u00fd ukazuje n\u00e1znak: CV \u22120,96 cm, pr\u016fm\u011br 6 kombinac\u00ed na validaci \u22121,2 cm, za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu\n  \u22123,9 a\u017e \u22124,6 cm. Plat\u00ed za to ale p\u0159est\u0159elen\u00edm: na de\u0161\u0165ov\u00e9 povodni 9/2010 p\u0159edpov\u011bd\u011bl 575 cm m\u00edsto 526\n  (bez sr\u00e1\u017eek 555) a dal 4 plan\u00e9 poplachy 3. stupn\u011b (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn a \u00dast\u00ed +24/+36 h). V LOFO zhor\u0161il t\u00e1n\u00ed 4/2006\n  o 3,9 cm. Do t\u00fdmov\u00e9ho LightGBM bych sr\u00e1\u017eky ned\u00e1val.\n- U t\u00fdmov\u00e9ho Ridge je mal\u00fd st\u00e1l\u00fd efekt jen na za\u010d\u00e1tku vzestupu: CV \u22120,9 cm, validace \u22121,9 cm, LOFO \u22120,9 cm.\n  Na celkovou chybu na povodn\u00edch to nesta\u010d\u00ed a u Danova Ridge s 30 stanicemi efekt nen\u00ed: horn\u00ed stanice uk\u00e1\u017eou\n  vlnu d\u0159\u00edv, ne\u017e by to um\u011bly sr\u00e1\u017eky ze 2 + 7 bod\u016f.\n- Pro\u010d ne v\u00edc: v ISD po roce ~2013 chyb\u00ed u 12 z 21 stanic hlavn\u011b such\u00e9 term\u00edny (nuly ze zpr\u00e1v BUFR), tak\u017ee z\u016fstalo\n  jen 9 stanic s \u00faplnou \u0159adou: 2 u D\u011b\u010d\u00edna a 7 d\u00e1l proti proudu. Na bou\u0159ky a m\u00edstn\u00ed d\u00e9\u0161\u0165 (jako 9/2010) je to\n  m\u00e1lo bod\u016f. P\u0159es 24 h k tomu v\u011bt\u0161inu de\u0161t\u011b, kter\u00fd spadl d\u0159\u00edv, u\u017e uk\u00e1\u017eou vodom\u011bry.\n\n## Data\n\n- **Zdroj:** NOAA NCEI Global Hourly (Integrated Surface Database). Seznam stanic `isd-history.csv` z ncei.noaa.gov,\n  data `https://noaa-global-hourly-pds.s3.amazonaws.com/<rok>/<USAF>99999.csv` (adresa\n  `ncei.noaa.gov/data/global-hourly/access/\u2026` dnes p\u0159esm\u011brov\u00e1v\u00e1 na tuto kopii NOAA na AWS). Podm\u00ednky: data\n  NOAA/NCEI voln\u011b bez omezen\u00ed (d\u00edlo vl\u00e1dy USA), data v\u00fdm\u011bny WMO podle Resolution 40 (voln\u00e9 nekomer\u010dn\u00ed pou\u017eit\u00ed,\n  uv\u00e9st zdroj). Stahov\u00e1n\u00ed \u0161etrn\u00e9: nejv\u00fd\u0161 3 soub\u011b\u017en\u011b, pauza 1,5 s, cache na disku, nic dvakr\u00e1t, v\u0161ech 421 adres\n  ve `STAZENO.csv`. Data nejsou v Gitu, postav\u00ed je `python srazky_dan/stahni_isd.py data \u2026` a `python srazky_dan/srazky.py`.\n- **Sta\u017een\u00e9 stanice (21, 2006\u20132025, \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd rok nechyb\u00ed):** u D\u011b\u010d\u00edna \u00dast\u00ed nad Labem, Doksany, Mile\u0161ovka, Liberec\n  (povod\u00ed Nisy, ale u Jizersk\u00fdch hor a Plou\u010dnice, Jizera vlastn\u00ed synop nem\u00e1); Oh\u0159e Cheb, Karlovy Vary, Tu\u0161imice;\n  Berounka Plze\u0148-Mikulka, P\u0159imda; Vltava a S\u00e1zava Chur\u00e1\u0148ov, Kocelovice, Temel\u00edn, \u010cesk\u00e9 Bud\u011bjovice, Praha-Ruzyn\u011b,\n  Praha-Libu\u0161, Ko\u0161etice, P\u0159ibyslav; horn\u00ed Labe Pec pod Sn\u011b\u017ekou, Pardubice, \u010c\u00e1slav, \u00dast\u00ed nad Orlic\u00ed.\n- **Pou\u017eit\u00e9 stanice (9):** jen ty, kter\u00e9 maj\u00ed 6h \u00fahrn v 00/12 UTC aspo\u0148 v 80 % term\u00edn\u016f v ka\u017ed\u00e9m tr\u00e9ninkov\u00e9m roce\n  2006\u20132018. U ostatn\u00edch po roce ~2013 chyb\u011bj\u00ed hlavn\u011b such\u00e9 term\u00edny: pod\u00edl kladn\u00fdch \u00fahrn\u016f mezi platn\u00fdmi stoupl\n  z ~0,2 na 0,6\u20130,9, tak\u017ee pr\u016fm\u011br skupiny by sr\u00e1\u017eky nadhodnotil. Hranice je ostr\u00e1 (pou\u017eit\u00e9 \u2265 0,80, vy\u0159azen\u00e9 \u2264 0,39),\n  s roky 2006\u20132020 i 2006\u20132017 vyjde tot\u00e9\u017e. Pokryt\u00ed po letech ve `vysledky/pokryti_stanic.csv`.\n  - **bl\u00edzko D\u011b\u010d\u00edna:** \u00dast\u00ed nad Labem, Doksany;\n  - **d\u00e1l proti proudu:** Tu\u0161imice (Oh\u0159e), Plze\u0148-Mikulka (Berounka), Temel\u00edn a P\u0159ibyslav (Vltava, S\u00e1zava),\n    Pec pod Sn\u011b\u017ekou, Pardubice a \u00dast\u00ed nad Orlic\u00ed (horn\u00ed Labe).\n- **\u00dahrny:** pole AA1\u2013AA4 zpr\u00e1v SYNOP v term\u00ednech 00/06/12/18 UTC. \u010cesk\u00e9 stanice hl\u00e1s\u00ed 6h \u00fahrn v 00 a 12 UTC\n  a 12h \u00fahrn v 06 a 18 UTC. 6h d\u00edl kon\u010d\u00edc\u00ed v 06 (18) = 12h \u00fahrn \u2212 6h \u00fahrn v 00 (12); kdy\u017e 6h \u00fahrn chyb\u00ed, d\u011bl\u00ed se\n  12h \u00fahrn nap\u016fl. Stopov\u00e9 sr\u00e1\u017eky = 0. Vyhazuju kvalitu 3 a 7 (chybn\u00e9), podm\u00ednky 1 a 4\u20138, 9999 a nesmysln\u00e9 \u00fahrny\n  (6h > 150 mm, 12h > 250 mm). Podm\u00ednka 3 nese v souborech od ~2013 b\u011b\u017en\u00e9 zm\u011b\u0159en\u00e9 \u00fahrny (ov\u011b\u0159eno proti zpr\u00e1v\u011b\n  SYNOP v poli REM), kvalitu 2 a 6 (podez\u0159el\u00e9) nech\u00e1v\u00e1m.\n- **\u010casov\u00e1n\u00ed (\u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd \u00fanik z budoucnosti):** \u00fahrn pat\u0159\u00ed ke konci obdob\u00ed E a do modelu sm\u00ed od E + 1 h, v\u0161e v UTC.\n  D\u00edl kon\u010d\u00edc\u00ed v 00/12, kter\u00fd se dorovn\u00e1 a\u017e z 12h \u00fahrnu v 06/18, vstupuje dorovnan\u00fd a\u017e od 07/19. P\u0159\u00edznak v hodin\u011b t\n  je sou\u010det za 6/12/24/48/72 h kon\u010d\u00edc\u00ed posledn\u00edm term\u00ednem E \u2264 t \u2212 1 h, jen ze zpr\u00e1v s koncem \u2264 E. Nejstar\u0161\u00ed\n  pou\u017eit\u00e9 m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed je t \u2212 90 h a s t\u00edm po\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 i d\u011blen\u00ed na train/val (\u0159\u00e1dky p\u0159es hranici se vyhazuj\u00ed).\n- **D\u00edry:**\n  - chyb\u011bj\u00edc\u00ed 6h d\u00edly v okn\u011b nahrad\u00ed pr\u016fm\u011br zn\u00e1m\u00fdch d\u00edl\u016f t\u00e9ho\u017e okna, pokud je jich aspo\u0148 polovina;\n  - kdy\u017e chyb\u00ed cel\u00fd term\u00edn, plat\u00ed je\u0161t\u011b sou\u010dty p\u0159edchoz\u00edho term\u00ednu (nejv\u00fd\u0161 o 6 h star\u0161\u00ed);\n  - jinak NaN a \u0159\u00e1dek se vyhod\u00ed u obou variant.\n\n  V letech 2006\u20132020 tak chyb\u00ed nejv\u00fd\u0161 0,7 % hodin a v oknech valida\u010dn\u00edch povodn\u00ed nic. Prvn\u00ed verze tabulky bez\n  pr\u016fm\u011brov\u00e1n\u00ed d\u00edl\u016f vyhazovala 66\u2013126 h p\u0159\u00edmo v povodn\u00edch 9/2010, 1/2011 a 3/2009: 25. 9. 2010 v 06 UTC chyb\u011bla\n  zpr\u00e1va v \u00dast\u00ed i v Doksanech, tedy pr\u00e1v\u011b na za\u010d\u00e1tku de\u0161t\u011b. Ty b\u011bhy jsem zahodil.\n- **P\u0159\u00edznaky:** hlavn\u00ed sada (rozhodnut\u00e1 p\u0159edem, podle n\u00ed verdikt) = skupiny \u201ebl\u00edzko\u201c a \u201ed\u00e1l\u201c \u00d7 okna 6/12/24/48/72 h,\n  10 sloupc\u016f v mm. Citlivostn\u00ed sada = \u201ebl\u00edzko\u201c + 4 d\u00edl\u010d\u00ed povod\u00ed (Oh\u0159e, Berounka, Vltava, horn\u00ed Labe) \u00d7 5 oken,\n  25 sloupc\u016f. Tabulka `data/srazky_6h.parquet`, otisk 0fa9e49a.\n- **Kontrola \u010dasov\u00e1n\u00ed:** `kontrola_casovani.py` na \u00dast\u00ed i Doksanech:\n  - 300 n\u00e1hodn\u011b zm\u011bn\u011bn\u00fdch nebo smazan\u00fdch zpr\u00e1v, \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd p\u0159\u00edznak p\u0159ed E + 1 h se nezm\u011bnil;\n  - pevn\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edpady t = E, E + 1 h, E + 6 h, E + 7 h, E + 72 h a E + 73 h sed\u00ed;\n  - 24h sou\u010dty sed\u00ed s p\u0159\u00edm\u00fdm v\u00fdpo\u010dtem z 12h \u00fahrn\u016f (rozd\u00edl jen tam, kde je v datech 6h \u00fahrn v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e 12h,\n    nejv\u00fd\u0161 1 mm, a p\u0159esn\u011b o n\u011bj).\n\n## Protokol\n\n- Ka\u017ed\u00fd model ve dvou variant\u00e1ch \u201ebeze zm\u011bny\u201c a \u201e+ sr\u00e1\u017eky\u201c, jinak nic nem\u011bn\u011bno. P\u016fvodn\u00ed soubory z\u016fstaly beze\n  zm\u011bny, varianty jsou obaly v `obaly.py`:\n  - (a) t\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge = `src/models/ridge.py` na 98 t\u00fdmov\u00fdch vstupech, sr\u00e1\u017eky se neodmoc\u0148uj\u00ed;\n  - (b) Dan\u016fv Ridge = `ridge_dan/model_ridge.py`, 224 vstup\u016f (30 stanic), alpha 1, jen D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h;\n  - (c) LightGBM = `src/models/lgbm.py` (lgbm_c) se sr\u00e1\u017ekami p\u0159ipojen\u00fdmi k jeho vstup\u016fm, seedy 42/43/44.\n- **Stejn\u00e9 \u0159\u00e1dky:** ob\u011b varianty tr\u00e9nuj\u00ed i hodnot\u00ed na identick\u00fdch \u0159\u00e1dc\u00edch, assert to hl\u00edd\u00e1 v CV i validaci.\n  Po pr\u016fniku se sr\u00e1\u017ekami zbylo 107 314 tr\u00e9novac\u00edch a 18 982 valida\u010dn\u00edch \u0159\u00e1dk\u016f (p\u016fvodn\u011b 107 662 / 19 264).\n  Varianta beze zm\u011bny d\u00e1v\u00e1 na p\u016fvodn\u00edch \u0159\u00e1dc\u00edch p\u0159esn\u011b zn\u00e1m\u00e1 \u010d\u00edsla:\n  - t\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge: CV 15,64, validace 15,5, pr\u016fm\u011br 17,08;\n  - Dan\u016fv Ridge: 14,17 a 17,8;\n  - LightGBM: 18,05, 21,3 a 23,07.\n- **CV** = Danova \u010dasov\u00e1 CV uvnit\u0159 tr\u00e9ninku (6 blok\u016f let, mezera 10 dn\u00ed, pr\u016fm\u011br p\u0159es 18 povodn\u00ed nad 400 cm),\n  D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h. **Validace** = t\u00fdmov\u00fd split. T\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge a LightGBM maj\u00ed v\u0161ech 6 kombinac\u00ed (`prumer_povodne` jako\n  `porovnej.py`), Dan\u016fv Ridge jen D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h. Plan\u00e9 a prop\u00e1snut\u00e9 poplachy 2. a 3. SPA podle `evaluate.varovani`.\n- **Za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu** = za 24 h stoupne aspo\u0148 o 50 cm, ale posledn\u00edch 6 h stouplo m\u00e9n\u011b ne\u017e o 10 cm. Zvl\u00e1\u0161\u0165\n  povodn\u011b 9/2010 (m\u00edstn\u00ed d\u00e9\u0161\u0165) a 4/2006 (t\u00e1n\u00ed), okno 7 dn\u00ed p\u0159ed a\u017e 5 dn\u00ed po vrcholu.\n- **LOFO-CV (p\u0159\u00edsn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed):** 22 povodn\u00ed 2006\u20132020 se stejn\u00fdmi foldy jako ostatn\u00ed (`vysledky/lofo_foldy.csv`,\n  p\u0159evzato z `stanice_vsem`, sha1 ad383c28). Fold dr\u017e\u00ed okno povodn\u011b a z tr\u00e9ninku vy\u0159ad\u00ed okno \u00b1 20 dn\u00ed. Zlep\u0161en\u00ed\n  plat\u00ed jen p\u0159i pr\u016fm\u011bru lep\u0161\u00edm aspo\u0148 o 1 cm a zlep\u0161en\u00ed v\u011bt\u0161iny povodn\u00ed.\n\n## V\u00fdsledky (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h, chyba v cm, stejn\u00e9 \u0159\u00e1dky)\n\nRozd\u00edl = + sr\u00e1\u017eky \u2212 beze zm\u011bny, z\u00e1porn\u00fd = men\u0161\u00ed chyba.\n\n| model | varianta | CV povodn\u011b | CV za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu | VAL D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 povodn\u011b | VAL pr\u016fm\u011br 6 kombinac\u00ed | VAL za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu | VAL 9/2010 | VAL 4/2006 | plan\u00e9 2./3. SPA (VAL) | LOFO 22 povodn\u00ed | LOFO za\u010d\u00e1tek | LOFO zlep\u0161eno |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Ridge t\u00fdmov\u00fd | beze zm\u011bny | 15,64 | 35,00 | 15,5 | 17,08 | 35,4 | 20,8 | 16,0 | 0 / 0 | 15,29 | 41,9 | |\n| | + sr\u00e1\u017eky | 15,65 | 34,14 | 15,4 | 17,05 | 33,5 | 20,4 | 15,6 | 0 / 0 | 15,32 | 41,0 | 12 z 22 |\n| | rozd\u00edl | +0,01 | \u22120,86 | \u22120,1 | \u22120,03 | \u22121,9 | \u22120,4 | \u22120,4 | 0 / 0 | +0,04 | \u22120,9 | p = 0,83 |\n| Ridge Dan\u016fv (30 stanic) | beze zm\u011bny | 14,16 | 28,95 | 17,8 | \u2013 | 28,1 | 20,7 | 24,6 | 0 / 0 | 14,79 | 34,1 | |\n| | + sr\u00e1\u017eky | 14,10 | 29,03 | 18,1 | \u2013 | 28,4 | 21,0 | 25,4 | 0 / 0 | 14,77 | 34,1 | 13 z 22 |\n| | rozd\u00edl | \u22120,07 | +0,08 | +0,3 | \u2013 | +0,3 | +0,3 | +0,8 | 0 / 0 | \u22120,03 | 0,0 | p = 0,52 |\n| LightGBM (seedy 42/43/44, rozptyl 0) | beze zm\u011bny | 17,77 | 36,40 | 20,8 | 23,03 | 36,4 | 21,1 | 28,9 | 0 / 0 | 16,73 | 43,2 | |\n| | + sr\u00e1\u017eky | 16,81 | 35,54 | 20,3 | 21,85 | 31,8 | 22,9 | 28,1 | 0 / 4 | 16,21 | 39,3 | 13 z 22 |\n| | rozd\u00edl | \u22120,96 | \u22120,86 | \u22120,5 | \u22121,18 | \u22124,6 | +1,8 | \u22120,8 | 0 / +4 | \u22120,52 | \u22123,9 | p = 0,52 |\n\nProp\u00e1snuto nebylo nic u \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9ho modelu ani varianty: validace 2. i 3. SPA, LOFO 2. i 3. SPA. Plan\u00e9 poplachy\nv LOFO (2. / 3. SPA):\n- t\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge 4 / 1 u obou variant;\n- Dan\u016fv Ridge 3 / 1 u obou variant;\n- LightGBM 6 / 1 \u2192 3 / 1.\n\nNa validaci m\u00e1 LightGBM se sr\u00e1\u017ekami 4 plan\u00e9 poplachy 3. SPA. Je to jedna epizoda, povode\u0148 9/2010, viditeln\u00e1\nv D\u011b\u010d\u00edn\u011b i \u00dast\u00ed +24 a +36 h. LightGBM je spo\u010d\u00edtan\u00fd se seedy 42, 43 a 44: CV, validace i LOFO vy\u0161ly u v\u0161ech t\u0159\u00ed\nna setinu stejn\u011b (pr\u016fm\u011br = hodnota v tabulce, sm\u011brodatn\u00e1 odchylka 0), proto\u017ee tento LightGBM nem\u00e1 n\u00e1hodn\u00fd v\u00fdb\u011br\n\u0159\u00e1dk\u016f ani vstup\u016f (stejn\u011b jako v `docs/POKUSY.md`, p\u00e1 20:00).\n\nLOFO po povodn\u00edch:\n- **Ridge:** t\u00fdmov\u00fd m\u00e1 rozd\u00edly od \u22120,7 (8/2010) do +1,3 cm (6/2013), Dan\u016fv od \u22120,4 do +0,5 cm. Ani jedna\n  povode\u0148 se nezlep\u0161ila aspo\u0148 o 1 cm. Povode\u0148 9/2010 (m\u00edstn\u00ed d\u00e9\u0161\u0165) je \u22120,4 a +0,2, 4/2006 (t\u00e1n\u00ed) +0,1 a +0,5.\n- **LightGBM:** rozd\u00edly od \u22123,6 (6/2013) do +3,9 cm (4/2006). Lep\u0161\u00ed jsou letn\u00ed a de\u0161\u0165ov\u00e9 povodn\u011b (5/2006 \u22121,9,\n  7/2006 \u22123,0, 12/2012 \u22122,9, 1/2011 \u22122,7, 6/2013 \u22123,6). Hor\u0161\u00ed je t\u00e1n\u00ed 4/2006 (+3,9), 3/2012 (+2,0) a ob\u011b\n  povodn\u011b 2010 (8/2010 +1,1, 9/2010 +0,6).\n\nCitlivostn\u00ed sada (bl\u00edzko + 4 d\u00edl\u010d\u00ed povod\u00ed, 25 sloupc\u016f) dopadla stejn\u011b:\n- t\u00fdmov\u00fd Ridge: CV povodn\u011b 15,64 \u2192 15,66, validace D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h 15,5 \u2192 15,3, za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu na validaci\n  35,4 \u2192 32,8, 9/2010 20,8 \u2192 19,9;\n- Dan\u016fv Ridge: CV 14,16 \u2192 14,15, validace 17,8 \u2192 18,0.\n\nAni jemn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed rozd\u011blen\u00ed povod\u00ed tedy nepom\u016f\u017ee.\n\n## Verdikt po modelech\n\n| model | verdikt | pro\u010d |\n|---|---|---|\n| Ridge t\u00fdmov\u00fd | **beze zm\u011bny** | CV +0,01, VAL \u22120,1, LOFO +0,04 cm (12 z 22 povodn\u00ed lep\u0161\u00edch); jen za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu o 0,9\u20131,9 cm lep\u0161\u00ed, pod hranic\u00ed nebo jen na validaci |\n| Ridge Dan\u016fv (30 stanic) | **beze zm\u011bny** | CV \u22120,07, VAL +0,3, LOFO \u22120,03 cm (13 z 22); horn\u00ed vodom\u011bry nesou tot\u00e9\u017e co sr\u00e1\u017eky, d\u0159\u00edv |\n| LightGBM | **beze zm\u011bny** (n\u00e1znak zlep\u0161en\u00ed, ale p\u0159est\u0159eluje) | CV \u22120,96, VAL D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 \u22120,5, pr\u016fm\u011br 6 kombinac\u00ed \u22121,18, LOFO \u22120,52 (13 z 22, p = 0,52); za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu \u22123,9 a\u017e \u22124,6, ale 9/2010 +1,8 a 4 plan\u00e9 poplachy 3. SPA nav\u00edc, LOFO 4/2006 +3,9 |\n\n## N\u00e1lezy Codexu\n\nDv\u011b kontroly `codex exec -s read-only` s pravidly v promptu (nic nem\u011bnit, ne\u010d\u00edst .env ani \u00fadaje Kaggle, n\u00e1lezy se\nsouborem, \u0159\u00e1dkem a z\u00e1va\u017enost\u00ed). Prompty a pln\u00e9 odpov\u011bdi jsou v `codex/`, reakce v `NALEZY_CODEX.md`.\n\n- **(a) \u010dasov\u00e1n\u00ed sr\u00e1\u017eek** (`srazky.py`, test): p\u0159\u00edm\u00fd \u00fanik z budoucnosti nena\u0161el. M\u011bl t\u0159i st\u0159edn\u00ed n\u00e1lezy, v\u0161echny\n  jsem opravil:\n  - nejstar\u0161\u00ed m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed sah\u00e1 d\u00e1l ne\u017e 78 h, nastaveno na 90 h a s t\u00edm po\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 d\u011blen\u00ed na \u010d\u00e1sti;\n  - test bral zpo\u017ed\u011bn\u00ed z kontrolovan\u00e9ho k\u00f3du, te\u010f m\u00e1 pevnou hodinu a pevn\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edpady;\n  - shoda sou\u010dt\u016f se jen vypisovala, te\u010f ji hl\u00eddaj\u00ed aserce.\n\n  N\u00edzk\u00fd n\u00e1lez (rozpor 6h > 12h) je zd\u016fvodn\u011bn\u00fd: 6h \u00fahrn z\u016fst\u00e1v\u00e1, proto\u017ee ho model u\u017e pou\u017e\u00edval.\n- **(b) stejn\u00e9 \u0159\u00e1dky a varianty** (`obaly.py`, `spust_srazky.py`, `spolecne.py`, `tabulka_vysledku.py`):\n  potvrdil stejn\u00e9 \u0159\u00e1dky, `y` i zna\u010dky \u010d\u00e1st\u00ed a to, \u017ee se varianty li\u0161\u00ed jen sr\u00e1\u017ekami. Obal LightGBM bez sr\u00e1\u017eek d\u00e1v\u00e1\n  p\u0159esn\u011b stejn\u00e9 p\u0159edpov\u011bdi jako `lgbm_c.fit` a sr\u00e1\u017eky se p\u0159ipojuj\u00ed podle UTC bez posunu. Dva st\u0159edn\u00ed n\u00e1lezy:\n  - v\u00fdb\u011br stanic podle pokryt\u00ed v\u010detn\u011b let 2019\u20132020: zd\u016fvodn\u011bno, s roky 2006\u20132018 vyjde stejn\u00fdch 9 stanic,\n    k\u00f3d te\u010f bere 2006\u20132018;\n  - souhrn mohl sp\u00e1rovat z\u00e1znamy z r\u016fzn\u00fdch b\u011bh\u016f: opraveno, kontroluje otisk, historii a po\u010dty \u0159\u00e1dk\u016f v p\u00e1ru.\n\n## Slabiny\n\n- Jen 9 stanic s \u00faplnou \u0159adou, 2 z nich u D\u011b\u010d\u00edna. ISD nem\u00e1 od ~2015 nuly ze zpr\u00e1v BUFR, proto 12 stanic vypadlo.\n  Hodinov\u00e9 sr\u00e1\u017eky \u010cHM\u00da by byly hust\u0161\u00ed, ale jsou a\u017e od 2018.\n- Pro test 2021\u20132025 by tabulka nebyla \u00fapln\u00e1: v letech 2024\u20132025 chyb\u00ed 35\u201338 % hodin (v\u00fdpadky zpr\u00e1v u Doksan,\n  Temel\u00edna a Pardubic). Test jsem ale nespou\u0161t\u011bl a podle v\u00fdsledk\u016f ho kv\u016fli sr\u00e1\u017ek\u00e1m ani spou\u0161t\u011bt nem\u00e1 smysl.\n- Sr\u00e1\u017eky jsou nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e9, ne p\u0159edpov\u011bzen\u00e9. P\u0159es 24 h dop\u0159edu by v\u00edc mohla d\u00e1t sr\u00e1\u017ekov\u00e1 p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f (ALADIN, ICON),\n  ta ale do roku 2006 zp\u011btn\u011b voln\u011b nen\u00ed.\n\nOt\u00e1zka poroty a odpov\u011b\u010f: \u201ePro\u010d jste nep\u0159idali sr\u00e1\u017eky, kdy\u017e povodn\u011b d\u011bl\u00e1 d\u00e9\u0161\u0165?\u201c Zkusili jsme je dvakr\u00e1t. Denn\u00ed\n\u00fahrny \u010cHM\u00da jsou zn\u00e1m\u00e9 a\u017e druh\u00fd den r\u00e1no. \u0160estihodinov\u00e9 ze synoptick\u00fdch zpr\u00e1v p\u0159ijdou hodinu po m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed, ani ty ale\nchybu na povodn\u00edch nezlep\u0161ily ani o 1 cm, ani v p\u0159\u00edsn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed kontrole p\u0159es 22 povodn\u00ed (Ridge o 0,0, LightGBM o 0,5 cm).\nLightGBM s nimi sice d\u0159\u00edv pozn\u00e1 za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu, ale na de\u0161\u0165ov\u00e9 povodni 2010 p\u0159est\u0159elil a vyhl\u00e1sil plan\u00fd\n3. stupe\u0148. Co spadlo, uk\u00e1\u017eou\nvodom\u011bry proti proudu za p\u00e1r hodin taky, a p\u0159esn\u011bji, proto\u017ee m\u011b\u0159\u00ed cel\u00e9 povod\u00ed, ne jeden bod. Pomoct by mohla a\u017e\nsr\u00e1\u017ekov\u00e1 p\u0159edpov\u011b\u010f.\n", "origin/dan-sit:sit_dan/SIT_VARIANTY.md": "# T\u00fdmov\u00e1 neuronov\u00e1 s\u00ed\u0165: beze zm\u011bny, + 18 stanic, + sr\u00e1\u017eky\n\nS\u00ed\u0165 je `src/models/mlp.py` z main beze zm\u011bny (MLP 128-64, alpha 1, early stopping, c\u00edl zm\u011bna hladiny, odmocnina\npr\u016ftok\u016f, \u0161k\u00e1lov\u00e1n\u00ed). Varianty se li\u0161\u00ed jen vstupy a v ka\u017ed\u00e9m srovn\u00e1n\u00ed b\u011b\u017e\u00ed na stejn\u00fdch \u0159\u00e1dc\u00edch (ov\u011b\u0159il i Codex,\n`codex/kontrola_sit.md`). Po\u010d\u00edtalo se na Kaggle (scikit-learn na CPU, 4 j\u00e1dra), postup je v `PRUBEH.md`.\nTest 2021\u20132025 se nespou\u0161t\u011bl.\n\n**Reprodukce:** varianta a se seedem 42 d\u00e1v\u00e1 na Kaggle 17,83 cm (po kombinac\u00edch 9,3 / 18,4 / 25,7 / 9,0 / 16,5 / 28,1),\nna desetinu stejn\u011b jako t\u00fdmov\u00fd v\u00fdsledek (`results/2026-10-23_195305_mlp.json`).\n\n## Souhrn\n\nCV = \u010dasov\u00e1 CV v tr\u00e9ninku (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h), validace = pr\u016fm\u011br p\u0159es 6 kombinac\u00ed, za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu a povodn\u011b 2006 a 2010\nz validace (D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h), LOFO = 22 povodn\u00ed, D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h. V\u0161echno v cm, pr\u016fm\u011br p\u0159es seedy 42\u201344 (LOFO jen seed 42).\nRozd\u00edly proti a jsou p\u00e1rov\u00e9 na stejn\u00fdch \u0159\u00e1dc\u00edch. Zlep\u0161en\u00ed se po\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 a\u017e od 1 cm v CV a bez hor\u0161\u00edch varov\u00e1n\u00ed.\n\n| varianta | CV povodn\u011b | validace | za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu | 2006 | 2010 | plan\u00e9 poplachy / prop\u00e1snuto (2.+3. st.) | LOFO +24 h | verdikt |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| a: beze zm\u011bny | 16,05 | 19,01 | 32,4 | 22,2 | 23,0 | 0,3 / 0,3 | 15,07 | z\u00e1klad |\n| b: + 18 stanic | \u22120,52 | +2,12 | \u22125,7 | +7,9 | \u22121,5 | \u22120,3 / +1,3 | +0,98 | beze zm\u011bny (na validaci hor\u0161\u00ed) |\n| c: + sr\u00e1\u017eky (jin\u00e9 \u0159\u00e1dky, proti a na nich) | +0,38 | +0,90 | \u22122,9 | +4,2 | +1,7 | 0,0 / \u22120,3 | nepo\u010d\u00edt\u00e1no | beze zm\u011bny |\n\n## 1. Beze zm\u011bny proti + 18 stanic: CV v tr\u00e9ninku a validace\n\nSeedy 42, 43, 44, pr\u016fm\u011br \u00b1 rozptyl (sm\u011brodatn\u00e1 odchylka p\u0159es seedy). CV = \u010dasov\u00e1 CV v tr\u00e9ninku po bloc\u00edch let\n(`hodnoceni.bloky_cv`, stejn\u011b jako `ridge_dan/pokus.py`), D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h, pr\u016fm\u011br p\u0159es 18 povodn\u00ed nad 400 cm.\nValidace = pr\u016fm\u011br `mae_povodne` p\u0159es 6 kombinac\u00ed c\u00edle a horizontu jako `porovnej.py`. Za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu a povodn\u011b\n2006 a 2010 jsou z validace, D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h. Poplachy a prop\u00e1snut\u00e9 povodn\u011b jsou sou\u010dty p\u0159es 6 kombinac\u00ed.\n\n| varianta | CV povodn\u011b | CV vzestup | validace povodn\u011b | za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu | povode\u0148 2006 | povode\u0148 2010 | plan\u00e9 poplachy 2.+3. st. | prop\u00e1snuto 2.+3. st. |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| a: beze zm\u011bny (98 vstup\u016f) | 16,05 \u00b1 0,20 | 32,65 \u00b1 0,64 | 19,01 \u00b1 1,18 | 32,40 \u00b1 0,22 | 22,17 \u00b1 0,74 | 23,03 \u00b1 0,91 | 0,3 | 0,3 |\n| b: + 18 stanic (224 vstup\u016f) | 15,53 \u00b1 0,47 | 28,13 \u00b1 0,69 | 21,14 \u00b1 0,59 | 26,73 \u00b1 0,66 | 30,10 \u00b1 2,38 | 21,50 \u00b1 0,16 | 0,0 | 1,7 |\n| **b \u2212 a** (p\u00e1rov\u011b po seedech) | **\u22120,52 \u00b1 0,45** | \u22124,52 \u00b1 1,05 | +2,12 \u00b1 0,62 | \u22125,67 \u00b1 0,49 | +7,93 \u00b1 2,69 | \u22121,53 \u00b1 1,07 | \u22120,3 | +1,3 |\n\nVerdikt: **beze zm\u011bny.** Podle CV se zlep\u0161\u00ed jen o 0,5 cm, to je pod hranic\u00ed 1 cm. Na validaci je + 18 stanic hor\u0161\u00ed\no 2,1 cm a prop\u00e1sne v\u00edc povodn\u00ed p\u0159ed 2. stupn\u011bm (1\u20132 na seed proti 0\u20131). U jarn\u00ed povodn\u011b 2006 je hor\u0161\u00ed o 8 cm a v\u00edc\np\u0159est\u0159eluje (nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00ed p\u0159est\u0159elen\u00ed p\u0159i stoup\u00e1n\u00ed 50\u201384 cm proti 41\u201352 cm). Lep\u0161\u00ed je jen na za\u010d\u00e1tku vzestupu (o 5,7 cm,\nv CV o 4,5 cm na rychl\u00e9m stoup\u00e1n\u00ed) a u povodn\u011b 2010 (o 1,5 cm).\n\nPozor na n\u00e1hodu: validace s\u00edt\u011b kol\u00eds\u00e1 mezi seedy a\u017e o 2,8 cm (varianta a 17,8\u201320,6 cm), u CV jen o 0,5 cm.\nRozd\u00edl na validaci je proto jen orienta\u010dn\u00ed, rozhoduje CV.\n\nTabulka po seedech (`souhrn_beh1.md`, p\u0159edpov\u011bdi `kaggle/vystup/labe-sit-dan-beh/`, mimo Git):\n\n| varianta | seed | CV povodn\u011b | validace povodn\u011b | za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu | 2006 | 2010 | prop\u00e1snuto |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| a | 42 | 15,78 | 17,83 | 32,7 | 21,8 | 24,3 | 0 |\n| a | 43 | 16,07 | 20,63 | 32,3 | 23,2 | 22,2 | 1 |\n| a | 44 | 16,28 | 18,58 | 32,2 | 21,5 | 22,6 | 0 |\n| b | 42 | 15,59 | 20,45 | 27,6 | 27,4 | 21,3 | 2 |\n| b | 43 | 14,92 | 21,88 | 26,0 | 29,7 | 21,7 | 2 |\n| b | 44 | 16,07 | 21,08 | 26,6 | 33,2 | 21,5 | 1 |\n\n## 2. LOFO-CV p\u0159es 22 povodn\u00ed 2006\u20132020\n\nFoldy ze session ridge (`lofo_foldy.csv`): dr\u017e\u00ed se okno povodn\u011b (7 dn\u00ed p\u0159ed a\u017e 5 po vrcholu), z tr\u00e9ninku se vy\u0159ad\u00ed\nokno \u00b1 20 dn\u00ed, tr\u00e9nuje se na v\u0161em ostatn\u00edm z let 2006\u20132020. D\u011b\u010d\u00edn, 3 horizonty \u00d7 22 fold\u016f \u00d7 2 varianty = 132 tr\u00e9nink\u016f\nna 5 soub\u011b\u017en\u00fdch kernelech. **Jen seed 42**, se t\u0159emi seedy by to do 00:10 nedob\u011bhlo. Out-of-fold p\u0159edpov\u011bdi:\n`lofo/sit_lofo_oof.parquet` (mimo Git, form\u00e1t v `lofo/README.md`).\n\n| horizont | a | b | b \u2212 a | povodn\u00ed lep\u0161\u00edch s b | znam\u00e9nkov\u00fd test p | nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00ed zhor\u0161en\u00ed | za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu a / b | jarn\u00ed povode\u0148 2006 a / b |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| +12 h | 8,00 | 8,97 | +0,97 | 7 z 22 | 0,13 | +9,2 | 20,8 / 17,6 | 8,0 / 10,8 |\n| +24 h | 15,07 | 16,05 | +0,98 | 8 z 22 | 0,29 | +8,0 | 39,2 / 34,1 | 15,6 / 23,4 |\n| +36 h | 26,89 | 26,02 | \u22120,87 | 15 z 22 | 0,13 | +12,4 | 61,4 / 54,2 | 39,7 / 29,7 |\n\nChyba po povodn\u00edch, D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h (a / b / b \u2212 a):\n2006-04-02 15,6 / 23,4 / +7,8; 2006-05-31 18,8 / 11,8 / \u22127,0; 2006-07-01 14,2 / 13,5 / \u22120,7; 2006-08-09 12,4 / 13,8 / +1,4;\n2007-12-08 10,1 / 7,5 / \u22122,6; 2008-03-03 10,5 / 9,6 / \u22120,9; 2009-03-06 8,3 / 9,8 / +1,5; 2009-06-30 21,2 / 26,3 / +5,1;\n2010-03-02 8,3 / 9,9 / +1,6; 2010-03-22 6,4 / 6,7 / +0,3; 2010-06-03 11,3 / 9,9 / \u22121,4; 2010-08-08 30,6 / 35,6 / +5,0;\n2010-09-28 20,5 / 28,5 / +8,0; 2011-01-16 15,1 / 17,6 / +2,5; 2012-01-24 10,1 / 10,3 / +0,2; 2012-03-01 12,9 / 11,7 / \u22121,2;\n2012-12-29 12,9 / 11,0 / \u22121,9; 2013-01-08 11,0 / 11,9 / +0,9; 2013-02-01 11,3 / 13,4 / +2,1; 2013-06-05 44,4 / 44,6 / +0,2;\n2013-06-26 14,9 / 17,2 / +2,3; 2015-01-11 10,8 / 9,1 / \u22121,7.\n\nVerdikt LOFO: **beze zm\u011bny.** Rozd\u00edly jsou pod 1 cm a znam\u00e9nkov\u00fd test nic neukazuje (p 0,13\u20130,29). Na 12 a 24 h je\n+ 18 stanic sp\u00ed\u0161 hor\u0161\u00ed (lep\u0161\u00ed jen u 7 a 8 povodn\u00ed z 22), na 36 h sp\u00ed\u0161 lep\u0161\u00ed (15 z 22). To sed\u00ed s t\u00edm, \u017ee nov\u00e9 stanice\njsou hlavn\u011b d\u00e1l proti proudu a jejich voda dote\u010de a\u017e za v\u00edc ne\u017e den. Za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu je s nov\u00fdmi stanicemi lep\u0161\u00ed\nna v\u0161ech horizontech (o 3\u20137 cm). Jarn\u00ed povode\u0148 2006 je na 12 a 24 h hor\u0161\u00ed, na 36 h lep\u0161\u00ed. Jeden seed: s\u00ed\u0165 kol\u00eds\u00e1 mezi\nseedy v\u00edc, ne\u017e jsou tyhle rozd\u00edly, proto to beru jen jako sm\u011br.\n\n## 3. + sr\u00e1\u017eky\n\nDruh\u00fd b\u011bh: varianty a, b, c na stejn\u00fdch \u0159\u00e1dc\u00edch, jen hodiny, kde sr\u00e1\u017eky nechyb\u00ed (162 219 \u0159\u00e1dk\u016f D\u011b\u010d\u00edn +24 h m\u00edsto\n175 130, hranice \u010d\u00e1st\u00ed s nejstar\u0161\u00edm sr\u00e1\u017ekov\u00fdm m\u011b\u0159en\u00edm t \u2212 78 h jako v session sr\u00e1\u017eek). Sr\u00e1\u017eky jsou ze\n`srazky_dan/data/srazky_6h.parquet`, verze s otiskem 0fa9e49a, 10 sloupc\u016f `sr_blizko_*` a `sr_dal_*` (6\u201372 h, surov\u00e9 mm,\ns\u00ed\u0165 je jen \u0161k\u00e1luje). 108 tr\u00e9nink\u016f na 4 kernelech, seedy 42\u201344 (`souhrn_srazky.md`).\n\n| varianta | CV povodn\u011b | CV vzestup | validace povodn\u011b | za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu | povode\u0148 2006 | povode\u0148 2010 | plan\u00e9 poplachy 2.+3. st. | prop\u00e1snuto 2.+3. st. |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| a: beze zm\u011bny | 16,15 \u00b1 0,44 | 32,57 \u00b1 0,59 | 18,59 \u00b1 0,55 | 32,23 \u00b1 0,69 | 21,63 \u00b1 0,34 | 22,20 \u00b1 0,64 | 0,3 | 0,7 |\n| b: + 18 stanic | 15,56 \u00b1 0,73 | 27,89 \u00b1 0,80 | 21,34 \u00b1 0,28 | 27,47 \u00b1 0,66 | 28,90 \u00b1 2,84 | 22,70 \u00b1 2,02 | 0,3 | 2,7 |\n| c: + sr\u00e1\u017eky | 16,54 \u00b1 0,95 | 31,65 \u00b1 0,42 | 19,49 \u00b1 0,21 | 29,33 \u00b1 0,66 | 25,80 \u00b1 2,94 | 23,87 \u00b1 1,61 | 0,3 | 0,3 |\n| **c \u2212 a** (p\u00e1rov\u011b) | **+0,38 \u00b1 1,27** | \u22120,92 \u00b1 0,66 | +0,90 \u00b1 0,45 | \u22122,90 \u00b1 0,08 | +4,17 \u00b1 3,06 | +1,67 \u00b1 2,21 | 0,0 | \u22120,3 |\n| b \u2212 a (p\u00e1rov\u011b) | \u22120,59 \u00b1 0,98 | \u22124,69 \u00b1 0,42 | +2,75 \u00b1 0,81 | \u22124,77 \u00b1 1,30 | +7,27 \u00b1 3,10 | +0,50 \u00b1 1,70 | 0,0 | +2,0 |\n\nVerdikt: **+ sr\u00e1\u017eky beze zm\u011bny.** CV se nezlep\u0161\u00ed (+0,4 cm, rozptyl mezi seedy 1,3 cm), validace je o 0,9 cm hor\u0161\u00ed.\nPom\u016f\u017ee jen za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu (o 2,9 cm, u v\u0161ech seed\u016f), prop\u00e1snut\u00e9 povodn\u011b se nezhor\u0161\u00ed. Povodn\u011b 2006 a 2010 jsou\nse sr\u00e1\u017ekami hor\u0161\u00ed (o 4 a 2 cm). Jarn\u00ed povode\u0148 2006 byla z t\u00e1n\u00ed, tu sr\u00e1\u017eky nevysv\u011btl\u00ed. U 2010 to nesed\u00ed s \u010dek\u00e1n\u00edm,\n\u017ee tam d\u00e9\u0161\u0165 pom\u016f\u017ee, ale rozptyl mezi seedy je stejn\u011b velk\u00fd jako rozd\u00edl. Na stejn\u00fdch \u0159\u00e1dc\u00edch se zopakovalo i srovn\u00e1n\u00ed\n+ 18 stanic: CV \u22120,6 cm, validace +2,8 cm, v\u00edc prop\u00e1snut\u00fdch povodn\u00ed, stejn\u00fd obraz jako v prvn\u00edm b\u011bhu.\n\n## Celkov\u011b\n\nPro t\u00fdmovou s\u00ed\u0165 nepomohly ani nov\u00e9 stanice, ani sr\u00e1\u017eky. \u017d\u00e1dn\u00e1 varianta nezlep\u0161\u00ed CV aspo\u0148 o 1 cm a LOFO\n(po\u010d\u00edtan\u00e9 jen pro a a b) je taky beze zm\u011bny. Ob\u011b p\u0159idan\u00e9 sady zlep\u0161\u00ed jen za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu (stanice o 5\u20136 cm, sr\u00e1\u017eky o 3 cm).\n\n18 nov\u00fdch stanic: CV i LOFO beze zm\u011bny (pod 1 cm), na validaci sp\u00ed\u0161 hor\u0161\u00ed a s v\u00edc prop\u00e1snut\u00fdmi\npovodn\u011bmi. Jedin\u00e9, co pom\u00e1h\u00e1 soustavn\u011b, je za\u010d\u00e1tek vzestupu. U Ridge a LightGBM vy\u0161ly nov\u00e9 stanice v CV l\u00e9pe\n(o 1,5 a 2,0 cm, session ridge). Domn\u011bnka: s\u00ed\u0165 s 224 vstupy a jen p\u00e1r povodn\u011bmi v tr\u00e9ninku z nich vyt\u00e1hne v\u00edc \u0161umu ne\u017e u\u017eitku.\n\nCo chyb\u00ed: LOFO pro variantu se sr\u00e1\u017ekami (nestihlo se, 5 CPU kernel\u016f zab\u00edralo LOFO a/b), LOFO jen se seedem 42,\ntest 2021\u20132025 z\u00e1m\u011brn\u011b ne. Out-of-fold p\u0159edpov\u011bdi a/b pro sm\u011bsi: `lofo/sit_lofo_oof.parquet` (mimo Git).\nV\u00fdsledky v JSON: `vysledky/beh1_a_b.json`, `vysledky/beh2_a_b_c_srazky.json`, `vysledky/lofo_a_b.json`.\n"}

